{"id":"h6-10-p10","title":"Design live comments","scopeHtml":"<p>Scope: requirements, API, fan-out estimates, WebSocket gateways, sampling, batching, moderation. Questions are still to be written.</p>","notes":[{"id":"requirements","title":"Requirements","html":"<p><strong>Live comments are the scrolling chat beside a live stream or match: viewers post short messages and everyone watching sees them within a second or two.</strong> Think Twitch chat, YouTube Live chat, Instagram Live comments, Hotstar during an IPL match. The twist is the fan-out: one comment must reach millions of watchers.</p>\n<p><strong>Functional requirements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Post a comment on a live stream.</li>\n<li>Every viewer of that stream sees new comments in near real time, in a sensible order.</li>\n<li>Load recent history when joining (last 50 comments).</li>\n<li>Moderation: delete a comment, block a user, rate limit, spam filter.</li>\n<li>Optional: likes on comments, replay comments with the recorded video.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Non-functional requirements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>End-to-end latency under 2 s p99.</li>\n<li>Scale: 25M concurrent viewers on one stream (Hotstar reported 25M+ concurrent for cricket), 50k comments per second at a peak moment.</li>\n<li>High availability; losing a few comments is acceptable, losing the whole chat is not (best-effort delivery).</li>\n<li>Viewers cannot possibly read 50k comments/s, so sampling is allowed.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"flow\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 759.2 130\" width=\"759.2\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Write once, fan out to many watchers\"><defs><marker id=\"fa\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M102 65 L158 65\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M102 65 L158 65\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.200;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.200;0.201;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M261.2 65 L317.2 65\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M261.2 65 L317.2 65\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.200;0.400;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.200;0.400;0.401;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M427.6 65 L483.6 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M427.6 65 L483.6 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.400;0.600;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.400;0.600;0.601;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M601.2 34 L657.2 65\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M601.2 34 L657.2 65\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.600;0.800;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.600;0.800;0.801;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M427.6 65 L483.6 96\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M427.6 65 L483.6 96\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.400;0.600;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.400;0.600;0.601;1\"/></circle><rect x=\"12\" y=\"43\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"57\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Commenter</text><rect x=\"158\" y=\"43\" width=\"103.2\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"209.6\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Comment API</text><rect x=\"317.2\" y=\"43\" width=\"110.4\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"372.4\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Chat service</text><rect x=\"483.6\" y=\"12\" width=\"117.60000000000001\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"542.4\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Fan-out</text><rect x=\"483.6\" y=\"74\" width=\"117.60000000000001\" height=\"44\" rx=\"22\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"542.4\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Comment store</text><rect x=\"657.2\" y=\"43\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"702.2\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Viewers</text></svg><figcaption>Write once, fan out to many watchers</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>Decision gravity.</strong> Choose best-effort delivery with server-side sampling over guaranteed delivery of every comment. Exactly-once, ordered delivery to millions is extremely costly and nobody can read it anyway. It is reversible per stream (you can lower sampling for small streams).</p>\n<p><strong>Everyday analogy.</strong> A stadium announcer reading a few of the crowd's shouts over the loudspeaker; he cannot read all 50,000.</p>\n<p><strong>Common interview traps.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Promising guaranteed, ordered delivery of every comment to every viewer.</li>\n<li>Using polling every second for 25M viewers (25M requests/s).</li>\n<li>Treating a small chat room and a mega-stream as the same design.</li>\n</ul>"},{"id":"api","title":"API","html":"<p>Writes are plain HTTPS; reads are a persistent connection (WebSocket, SSE, or long-poll fallback).</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">POST /v</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/streams/s_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">77</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/comments</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Authorization: Bearer &#x3C;token></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"What a six!\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"clientMsgId\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c_2f9a\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">201</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"commentId\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cm_01HF...\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"createdAt\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-11-09T14:00:03.120Z\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">429</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> -> slow down (per-user rate limit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">403</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> -> user muted/blocked</span></span></code></pre>\n<p><code>clientMsgId</code> makes retries idempotent (a retry does not post twice).</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Subscribe: WebSocket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">GET wss:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//chat.example.com/v1/streams/s_77/subscribe?token=...&#x26;since=cm_01HF...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">-> server frames (batched every </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ms):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"batch\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"streamId\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"s_77\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"comments\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cm_..\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"user\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"asha\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"What a six!\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ts\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1731160803120</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dropped\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1840</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">GET /v</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/streams/s_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">77</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/comments?limit=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x26;before=cm_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">HF...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"comments\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [ </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B31D28;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#FDAEB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">...</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ], </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"nextCursor\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DELETE /v</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/streams/s_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">77</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/comments/cm_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">HF...   (moderator)  -> </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">204</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>Server pushes a <code>delete</code> frame so viewers remove the comment from view. <code>dropped</code> tells clients that sampling occurred.</p>\n<p><strong>Industry example.</strong> Twitch chat is IRC over WebSocket; YouTube Live chat is polled/streamed in batches; Hotstar described pushing events over persistent connections with heavy batching.</p>\n<p><strong>Everyday analogy.</strong> A radio phone-in: callers speak one at a time into the studio, then the broadcast reaches everyone.</p>\n<p><strong>Common interview traps.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>No <code>since</code> cursor, so reconnects lose or duplicate messages.</li>\n<li>Sending one frame per comment instead of batching.</li>\n<li>Letting viewers write directly to a socket without auth and rate limits.</li>\n</ul>"},{"id":"estimates","title":"Estimates","html":"<p>Assume a mega-event: 25M concurrent viewers, 50k comments/s at peak, 100 bytes per comment.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Calculation</th>\n<th>Result</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Connections</td>\n<td>25M WebSockets; one box holds ~100k-500k idle conns (kernel tuned, ~10 KB each)</td>\n<td>~100-250 gateway servers at 100k each</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Naive fan-out</td>\n<td>50k comments/s x 25M viewers</td>\n<td>1.25 trillion deliveries/s: impossible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sampled</td>\n<td>show ~20 comments/s per viewer (what a human reads)</td>\n<td>25M x 20 = 500M msgs/s; still large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Batched</td>\n<td>one frame per 500 ms with 10 comments = ~1.2 KB</td>\n<td>25M x 2 frames/s = 50M frames/s, ~60 GB/s = ~480 Gbit/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tiered</td>\n<td>gateway fan-out per box: 100k conns x 2 frames/s</td>\n<td>200k frames/s per box: fine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storage</td>\n<td>50k/s x 100 B = 5 MB/s; if a 3 h match avg 10k/s</td>\n<td>3 h x 3,600 x 10k x 100 B = ~11 GB per match</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Memory per stream</td>\n<td>ring buffer of last 200 comments</td>\n<td>tiny (~20 KB)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Key insight: the problem is fan-out bandwidth, not storage. We reduce it by sampling (less content), batching (fewer packets), and a hierarchical broadcast tree (fewer hops from the source).</p>\n<p><strong>Industry example.</strong> Hotstar's 25M concurrent record in 2019 and the published trick of capping per-viewer message rate.</p>\n<p><strong>Everyday analogy.</strong> Newspapers print one edition, not 25 million personalised ones.</p>\n<p><strong>Common interview traps.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Computing storage but not egress.</li>\n<li>Forgetting the cost per open connection (memory, file descriptors).</li>\n<li>Assuming one machine can hold all the sockets.</li>\n</ul>"},{"id":"high-level-design","title":"High-level design","html":"<figure class=\"flow\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1090 68\" width=\"1090\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Write path\"><defs><marker id=\"fa\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M102 34 L158 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M102 34 L158 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.167;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.167;0.168;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M261.2 34 L317.2 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M261.2 34 L317.2 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.167;0.333;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.167;0.333;0.334;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M449.2 34 L505.2 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M449.2 34 L505.2 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.500;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.500;0.501;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M694.8 34 L750.8 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M694.8 34 L750.8 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.500;0.667;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s